sentences.text:
The applicants are ordered to be released on bail in connection with FIR being C.R. No. 11208044250647 of 2025 registered with Pradhyumannagar Police Station, Rajkot City on executing a bond of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousands only) each with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
[a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
[b] not act in a manner injurious to the interest of the prosecution; [c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
 [d] not leave the State of Gujarat without prior

Abdul Hussainbhai Dodhiya vs State Of Gujarat on 3 December, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/191241745/
4  Sessions Court concerned;
 [e] Mark his presence in the concerned Police Stat week till charge-sheet is filed and thereafter once in a month for a period of six months between 11:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. [f] furnish the proposed residential address to the I.O. and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond

